TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 246152420}
  m_Text: 'RoofSnow

    Base: roof | Red: snow | Green: wet roof

    Paint Red:
    radius 0.45m, strength 0.35, flow 1, accumulate on.

    Falloff: EaseInOut;
    try Erase and Smooth; alpha is unused.

    Starting paint and textures are procedural.
    See README.'
